--- 原说明 ---
Given the condition `[Sub n]` and a vector `v : n → α`,
we define `circulant v` to be the circulant matrix generated by `v` of type `Mat
rix n n α`.
The `(i,j)`th entry is defined to be `v (i - j)`.
